    "status": "success",
    "final_answer_text": "The suppliers whose products are frequently ordered together in the same order are:\n\n1. **Plutzer Lebensmittelgro\u00dfm\u00e4rkte AG** with 386 occurrences\n2. **Specialty Biscuits, Ltd.** with 341 occurrences\n3. **Pavlova, Ltd.** with 337 occurrences\n4. **Gai p\u00e2turage** with 238 occurrences\n5. **Formaggi Fortini s.r.l.** with 224 occurrences\n\nThese suppliers provide products that are often included in the same customer orders.",
