    "final_answer_text": "Here is the monthly revenue trend based on the available data:\n\n- **July 1996**: CHF 27,861.90\n- **August 1996**: CHF 25,485.28\n- **September 1996**: CHF 26,381.40\n- **October 1996**: CHF 37,515.72\n- **November 1996**: CHF 45,600.05\n- **December 1996**: CHF 45,239.63\n- **January 1997**: CHF 61,258.07\n- **February 1997**: CHF 38,483.63\n- **March 1997**: CHF 38,547.22\n- **April 1997**: CHF 53,032.95\n- **May 1997**: CHF 53,781.29\n- **June 1997**: CHF 36,362.80\n- **July 1997**: CHF 51,020.86\n- **August 1997**: CHF 47,287.67\n- **September 1997**: CHF 55,629.24\n- **October 1997**: CHF 66,749.23\n- **November 1997**: CHF 43,533.81\n- **December 1997**: CHF 71,398.43\n- **January 1998**: CHF 94,222.11\n- **February 1998**: CHF 99,415.29\n\nThe trend shows a general increase in revenue over time, with some fluctuations.",
